From 6082b7fe6d2c1cf1ffb0dd80809b442eea177b72 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonas <jonas.badalic@sentry.io>
Date: Wed, 9 Oct 2024 10:47:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ref(trace) split trace node class (#78306)

Fall cleaning time has come. The previous trace node class contained all
of the trace definitions, which at ~2k loc started to get annoying to
work in. This change breaks up that class into separate files as well as
does some minor renaming of type -> shape so that the naming is
consistent across usage.

The PR got large as that class had grown big, however 99% of the changes
are just moving code to its new location

---------

Co-authored-by: getsantry[bot] <66042841+getsantry[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
